## Inputs and Outputs

| Signal   | Direction | Description                     |
| -------- | --------- | ------------------------------- |
| `clk`    | Input     | Clock signal                    |
| `reset`  | Input     | Resets counter to maximum value |
| `enable` | Input     | Enables counting                |
| `count`  | Output    | Current counter value           |

## Example

For `WIDTH = 4`:

```text
Reset = 1  →  Count = 15
Reset = 0, Enable = 1

15 → 14 → 13 → 12 → 11 → ... → 2 → 1 → 0 → 15
```

